    <briefdescription>
<para>Fan-out <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_i_chain_of_thought_tracer" kindref="compound">IChainOfThoughtTracer</ref></computeroutput> that forwards to N child tracers and accumulates spans itself. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Also acts as an aggregate span store: <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_co_t_trace_collector_1af6192a193a1dfae756bbe651d6a79c8f" kindref="member">spans()</ref></computeroutput> returns all complete spans received from all registered builders during the collector&apos;s lifetime.</para>
<para>Thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
